    </div>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Hilton</strong> is invisible — not named in the answer text and not cited as a clickable source. The family books a Marriott without ever seeing a Hilton listing.</p>
  </div>
</div>

